---
/* eslint-disable astro/no-unused-css-selector */
---

<details class='read-more'>
	<summary class='read-more-toggle body-xs text-primary-100'>
		<span class='read-more-label-open'>Read More</span>
		<span class='read-more-label-close'>Show Less</span>
	</summary>

	<div class='read-more-content body-xs text-primary-80'>
		<p>
			Currently, I&apos;m a <span class='text-primary-100 font-700'>
				Senior Front-End Engineer
			</span> at
			<span class='text-primary-100 font-700'>TelevisaUnivision</span>,
			specializing in performance and new features. I contribute to the creation
			and integration of UI components that power TelevisaUnivision&apos;s
			frontend, ensuring that the platform meets the highest standards of
			quality, performance, and best practices to deliver an outstanding user
			experience.
		</p>
		<p>
			In the past, I&apos;ve had the opportunity to develop software across a
			variety of environments, from <span class='text-primary-100 font-700'>
				start-ups
			</span> to <span class='text-primary-100 font-700'>
				large corporations
			</span> and <span class='text-primary-100 font-700'>
				digital banking products
			</span>.
		</p>
	</div>
</details>

<style>
	.read-more {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.read-more-toggle {
		width: fit-content;
		order: 2;
		padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
		border: 1px solid oklch(0.24 0.02 200deg / 30%);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		background-color: oklch(0.93 0.01 258deg / 30%);
		cursor: pointer;
		line-height: 1.5rem;
		list-style: none;
		transition: transform 300ms;
	}

	.read-more-toggle::-webkit-details-marker {
		display: none;
	}

	.read-more-toggle:hover {
		transform: scale(1.05);
	}

	.read-more-label-close {
		display: none;
	}

	.read-more[open] .read-more-label-open {
		display: none;
	}

	.read-more[open] .read-more-label-close {
		display: inline;
	}

	.read-more-content {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		order: 1;
		font-weight: 400;
		gap: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.625;
	}
</style>
